  "brain_first": "按原文查阅 最后必须记住的12句话",
  "sort_order": 1122,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 阅读不是全文翻译，题目问什么就找什么。",
      "sourcePage": 130,
      "sourceIndex": 3087
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 细节题：圈题干，回原文，找同义。",
      "sourcePage": 130,
      "sourceIndex": 3088
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. 推断题：只能多走半步。",
      "sourcePage": 130,
      "sourceIndex": 3089
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 主旨题：不要被一个细节吸走。",
      "sourcePage": 130,
      "sourceIndex": 3090
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 七选五：前后、代词、逻辑、词链。",
      "sourcePage": 130,
      "sourceIndex": 3091
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "6. 完形：别单看词，先看人物为什么现在这样做。",
      "sourcePage": 131,
      "sourceIndex": 3092
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "7. 生词：不影响当前题就先跳。",
      "sourcePage": 131,
      "sourceIndex": 3093
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "8. 动词：先看有没有谓语。",
      "sourcePage": 131,
      "sourceIndex": 3094
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "9. 从句：先看从句缺不缺成分。",
      "sourcePage": 131,
      "sourceIndex": 3095
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "10. 应用文：先把任务信息写全。",
      "sourcePage": 131,
      "sourceIndex": 3096
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "11. 续写：先看两段首句，再决定故事路线。",
      "sourcePage": 131,
      "sourceIndex": 3097
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "12. 正确 > 完整 > 清楚 > 自然 > 高级。",
      "sourcePage": 131,
      "sourceIndex": 3098
    }
  ],
